            "text": " base up 10 cm of straight double crochet sides. Sized for a standard 500 ml Kilner jar. All three cosies fit in one 100 m ball of DK cotton. Use three colourways or one. Keeps pantry jars protected from chipping and insulates a jar of cold water or hot soup on the go."
          }
